Navigate to the company website and search for customer testimonials or case studies. Check the homepage, customers, testimonials, case-studies, and reviews pages. Also check G2 and Capterra for verified reviews.

Extract up to 3 testimonials. For each, extract the quote, the customer name, and their company or role if available. Separate each testimonial with a blank line.
Output in this exact format:
"{Quote}" — {Name}, {Role or Company}

"{Quote}" — {Name}, {Role or Company}

"{Quote}" — {Name}, {Role or Company}

Never fabricate quotes. If fewer than 3 are found, output only those available. If no testimonials are found, output: Not found
